    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Derelict Cottage on Farmland\r\nLocated in pleasant rural countryside, this cottage is secluded and set about 300m from the nearest residence.\r\n\r\nThe cottage is semi-derelict and in need of total renovation, but has the potential to be a beautiful part-time or permanent residence.\r\n\r\nThe cottage sits on 9.6 acres of top-quality agricultural land, which could be sold with or without the cottage. There is also an option available to buy the cottage with 1 or 2 acres.\r\n\r\nThe property is accessed from the northern Powellsboro side via a narrow tarmac country laneway. Access is also available from the southern Doocastle road via a gravel laneway.\r\n\r\nThere are a number of mature sycamore trees enhancing the cottage.\r\n\r\nA number of old stone sheds at the cottage give scope for redevelopment or incorporation into the main cottage structure.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nCentral Building\r\n\r\nRoom 1 - 4.5 x 3.4m\r\nRoom 2 - 3.6 x 2m\r\nRoom 3 - 3.6 x 4m\r\n\r\nAttached Sheds\r\n\r\nShed 1 - 3.5 x 4m\r\nShed 2 - 6 x 3.5m\r\n\r\nDetached Shed - 6 x 4m\r\n\r\nServices\r\n\r\nMains water"
      }
    ],
